        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海之后，再捧冠军。你是从上海，还是巴塞尔记住他的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "75cb39b9134527f3a056108cf88ad138ae6d8d0c8d93a6bae397b3e5ad5b2eb6",
      "words_sha256": "dd87b26dffdd7e90c4fcf5063574e6e0e1e4ca4ea277de6446b04e578235dc6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1e83825e505b701c8ad0de5bf504f3beb6db0916581e371d059f81c4670ed223",
      "request_id": "1e83825e505b701c8ad0de5bf504f3beb6db0916581e371d059f81c4670ed223",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d708598fc8982043f0f3159a429393b7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，对面是莱赫奇卡。不到一个月前，他在东京刚输给过这个对手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "53132723fa733a6f0e0ed14ddaea0825e548005f1b4b46d76109dbaafa7513ee",
      "words_sha256": "cf04e40162f571cc81e202fd2e77aeb2f947a82f41038fd30053beb125d9e275"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:281c535adb3fcb17e774841b37bde7e36a2e8f994830e961eae635cb6d028d03",
      "request_id": "281c535adb3fcb17e774841b37bde7e36a2e8f994830e961eae635cb6d028d03",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8a78afd0e2289b3440074b68a69e0ce1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海夺冠一年后，他在巴塞尔再捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4a93029df386a060e83672429bff6ba66dd3fc33de8c9d2bd1f6baee0a533957",
      "words_sha256": "ddc443a9485082926fb2f1a10499c1b6106e0d26ef1ed94d638a224ac17966b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3662c68a8daddf10e2ad1b767b02a39344aed28a0134aae1ed15f3eda6d948c4",
      "request_id": "3662c68a8daddf10e2ad1b767b02a39344aed28a0134aae1ed15f3eda6d948c4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b789f2462fa5bebac419edeb0345b9b6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年上海，世界第二百零四的瓦舍罗，从资格赛一路赢到大师赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "24fded5c57f5fdb4875a4aed943e26d35632e0383f1829b82450a7ce2a373a48",
      "words_sha256": "fca6cc167cf016c36b2559a3dac505a9ae7b4d2985ea8370779ca85bf5fd870a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:76528da968e2b325a15de85863413786ab91077758978cf6a24f80e41731efb0",
      "request_id": "76528da968e2b325a15de85863413786ab91077758978cf6a24f80e41731efb0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7aba771cd7397e0ce6e3d0733ce5cd52",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了巴塞尔，先过纳沃内。六比三，七比六，拿下首轮。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a1561c8e0b155bb0da82083dd26ed20494b424d8430d90d3603ec44a325d5aed",
      "words_sha256": "38921528dcdf54a6e629864f174f74a40577b820d53719e2bb94d596357ad576"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8106b69250e2adaf239bf032f34776ab6039453d0e2a152f9dee5a0fe82ba839",
      "request_id": "8106b69250e2adaf239bf032f34776ab6039453d0e2a152f9dee5a0fe82ba839",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "168a9c1ffb62d00e0a9a46ccc1c34910",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "此后在巴黎打进8强，今年在蒙卡打进4强。随后左脚受伤，法网第二轮赛前退赛，也错过温网。复出以后，他又在东京打进4强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "92fde190cfe1731b627a1885e84ca286d34e88c022abd55c7245353cdef0d720",
      "words_sha256": "860760548fe9db02ecc1c987a7d1c0936e207f7bc497bb71ebb2cd753528c082"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:95077e1ab36d2dab670e8d76858cebf97857941359e81f0839891fbd4f61c62c",
      "request_id": "95077e1ab36d2dab670e8d76858cebf97857941359e81f0839891fbd4f61c62c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "18f2581f8c5b79096d318c12c018142a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，再过弗里茨。上海之后，瓦舍罗又打进了巡回赛决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e639775c565b15301e7d58f6191ca2fe2651c4ebc5a8456f63508ecc108bb0e5",
      "words_sha256": "575010ff3ad5d449742144475ac859cf8e919fd6d4ba2ff51abcde168b8295be"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a59a37d793aa8e33688fa3dbed4243c9367beab8ad18574e2d61840528455a6b",
      "request_id": "a59a37d793aa8e33688fa3dbed4243c9367beab8ad18574e2d61840528455a6b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7bbcbdfc4b5b971070b51fd6a7f92474",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这次破发让他拉开差距。六比三，瓦舍罗把比赛带进决胜盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3ac7b3f790f04c8b464606070e462ce90af06f70ea960621a7bfed31bd2de19a",
