        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘开局破发后，他守住了领先。最后一步，还要赢下冠军点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ac9b08cb8b60fd1bfbd90d28e63ebc4818b566edbb991522d6c2bfa72e7eec84",
